{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21808","headline":"有酒十章 二 · 元稹","name":"有酒十章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有酒有酒东方明，一杯既进吞元精。\n尚思天地之始名，一元既二分浊清。\n地居方直天体明，胡不八荒圢圢如砥平。\n胡山高屹崪海泓澄，胡不日车杲杲昼夜行。\n胡爲月轮灭缺星𥋝盯，呜呼不得真宰情，我可奈何兮杯再倾","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}